{"id":32064,"date":"2022-12-12T08:00:48","date_gmt":"2022-12-12T08:00:48","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/?p=32064"},"modified":"2023-05-17T10:54:59","modified_gmt":"2023-05-17T09:54:59","slug":"power-bi-training","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/power-bi-training\/","title":{"rendered":"Power BI Training: Learn From The Excel Experts"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Business professionals need to be able to make informed decisions, and having data-driven insights are critical to do so.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">However, many business professionals are unfamiliar with Power BI, a software that can help them make these insights.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Power BI is a powerful tool that allows you to create visualisations of your data and share and collaborate on your data with others. It can connect to various data sources, including <a href=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/excel-services\">Excel<\/a>, SQL Server, and Tableau.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Learning Power BI through The Excel Experts can help business owners <strong>better understand their data <\/strong>and make more informed decisions.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In addition, Power BI can help you<strong> find trends and patterns in your data<\/strong> that you may not have been able to see before. It is also a great tool for collaboration, allowing you to share your data with others and get their feedback.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Learning Power BI is a great place to start if you want to <strong>improve your business intelligence skills<\/strong>. With its easy-to-use interface and wide range of features, Power BI makes it easy for anyone to get started with data visualisation and analysis.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What is Power BI?<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/powerbi.microsoft.com\/en-cy\/\">Power BI i<\/a>s a cloud-based service for creating and sharing dashboards and reports.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">It integrates with Excel and other Microsoft Office applications, as well as with a variety of data sources, including cloud-based services like Salesforce and Google Analytics and on-premises data sources like SQL Server.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/dashboards-in-power-bi\/\">Power BI dashboards<\/a> and reports can be shared with other users in your organisation or published on the web for wider sharing. These dashboards can be customised to show the data most important to you and updated whenever new data is available.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" src=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/Power-Bi-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"Power Bi\" class=\"wp-image-32070\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/Power-Bi-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/Power-Bi-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/Power-Bi-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/Power-Bi-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/Power-Bi-2048x1152.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>5 Power BI Examples<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">There are many examples of <a href=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/power-bi-tips\/\">Power BI<\/a> being used to improve business operations. <strong>Here are just a few:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>1. Customer Churn Analysis<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Customer churn is one of the biggest issues faced by businesses today. It can be caused by several factors, such as poor customer service, a lack of innovation, or simply not meeting customer needs.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Businesses can use Power BI to identify which customers <strong>are most likely to churn and why.<\/strong> They can then use this information to create targeted marketing campaigns to retain those customers.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>2. Product Sales Data Analysis<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Businesses can use Power BI to analyse sales data<strong> to identify trends and opportunities.<\/strong> For example, it can be used to determine which products are selling the best or which sales channels are generating the most revenue.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This information can then be used to <strong>optimise marketing campaigns<\/strong> and financial planning.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>3. Marketing Campaign Insights Analysis<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Power BI can be used to analyse marketing campaign data to determine their effectiveness.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For example, it can track how many leads were generated by each campaign or how much revenue was generated. Businesses can then use this information <strong>to improve future marketing campaigns.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>4. Financial Performance Analysis<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Businesses<a href=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/power-bi-google-analytics\/\"> can use Power BI<\/a> to analyse financial performance data to make informed business decisions. For example, it can be used <strong>to track revenue and expenses<\/strong> over time or compare budgeted vs actual figures.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This can then be used to improve financial planning and forecasting.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>5. Healthcare Sales Analysis<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Power BI can be used to analyse healthcare sales data to identify trends and opportunities.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For example, it can be used to track prescription drug sales or compare healthcare spending <strong>across different demographics.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"735\" data-src=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/what-is-power-bi-1024x735.jpg\" alt=\"what is power bi\" class=\"wp-image-32074 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/what-is-power-bi-1024x735.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/what-is-power-bi-300x215.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/what-is-power-bi-768x551.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/what-is-power-bi.jpg 1076w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/735;\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Power BI Online Training<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The Excel Experts offer Power BI online training via remote access.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This means that you can learn at your own pace and receive one-to-one guidance from our expert trainers!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Alternatively, we offer a mixture of<a href=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/advanced-excel-training\/\"> blended learning<\/a> which means part online and part hands-on training. This is the perfect option if you want to gain practical experience as you learn.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Power BI Courses<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/dax-in-power-bi\/\">Power BI <\/a>is a suite of business analytics tools that helps you turn your data into actionable insights. With Power BI, you can:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Create reports and dashboards<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Share reports and dashboards with others<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Get insights from your data with natural language queries<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Power BI offers a range of solutions for small business owners to offer Power BI training for their employees.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Power BI Desktop is a free application you can download and use to create reports and dashboards. You can share your reports and dashboards with others by publishing them to the Power BI service.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The Power BI service is a cloud-based service that gives you access to your reports and dashboards from anywhere. You can also use the Power BI service to get insights from your data with natural language queries.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Learn Power BI For Desktop<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/aka.ms\/pbidesktopstore\">Power BI Desktop <\/a>is a powerful tool that can be used by office-based businesses to help them make data-driven decisions.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">It enables users to create reports and dashboards and then share them with others to get timely critical insights.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Power BI Desktop is also packed with features such as interactive visualisations and data query and modelling capabilities, making it the perfect tool for analysts.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"575\" data-src=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/Power-Bi-Desktop-1024x575.jpg\" alt=\"Power Bi Desktop\" class=\"wp-image-32073 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/Power-Bi-Desktop-1024x575.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/Power-Bi-Desktop-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/Power-Bi-Desktop-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/Power-Bi-Desktop-1536x863.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/Power-Bi-Desktop.jpg 1826w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/575;\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Power BI Tutorials<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our Power BI tutorials help business owners learn how to use Power BI to analyse their data and make better business decisions.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">They can also learn how to create reports and dashboards that will help them track their progress and performance. Additionally, business owners can learn <a href=\"https:\/\/go.microsoft.com\/fwlink\/?LinkId=874445&amp;clcid=0xc09&amp;cmpid=pbi-home-body-sta-free\">how to use Power BI<\/a> to collaborate with others, share insights, and get feedback.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Power BI Services<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Some of the Power BI services that are helpful to businesses across many industries include:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>1. Power BI Desktop:<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This powerful data analysis tool helps you transform your data into insightful visuals. You can use it to create reports, dashboards and datasets and share them with colleagues.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>2. Power BI Service<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This is a cloud-based platform that lets you collaborate with colleagues and share your visualisations with a wider audience.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>3. Power BI Mobile<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This <a href=\"https:\/\/app.powerbi.com\/\">app <\/a>gives you access to your business data on the go, so you can make decisions when and where you need to.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>4. Power BI Embedded<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This lets you embed <strong>interactive visualisations<\/strong> into your own websites and applications.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"735\" data-src=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/power-bi-training-1024x735.jpg\" alt=\"power bi training\" class=\"wp-image-32075 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/power-bi-training-1024x735.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/power-bi-training-300x215.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/power-bi-training-768x551.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/power-bi-training.jpg 1076w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/735;\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Why Choose The Excel Experts For Power BI Training?<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">At The Excel Experts, we understand that finding quality Power BI training can be difficult.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">That\u2019s why our experienced trainers are there to provide expert guidance and support throughout your Power BI learning journey. We also offer a range of online courses, including beginners&#8217; courses and advanced topics such as financial analysis and advanced data modelling.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Whatever power bi task you may have &#8211; The Excel Experts have the perfect course for you. Get in touch to learn more about our <strong>Power BI training and services.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">By studying with us, you can be sure that you will gain the skills and knowledge needed to effectively use Power BI for your business! Our courses are designed to ensure that you understand the concepts and can apply them in a real-world setting.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We also offer support beyond the course, so you can get help if you ever need it. So get in touch with The Excel Experts today and start your journey to success with Power BI!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>FAQs<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"schema-faq wp-block-yoast-faq-block\"><div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1669809684338\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\"><strong>What is Power BI used for?<\/strong><\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Power BI is a data analysis and visualisation platform from Microsoft. It can be used to create reports and dashboards that help businesses make informed decisions. It also includes features such as natural language query capabilities, interactive visualisations and data modelling tools.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1669809695329\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\"><strong>Is Power BI free?<\/strong><\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">The Power BI Desktop application is free to download and use. However, the Power BI Service (available in both Pro and Premium tiers) requires a paid subscription.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1669809716073\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\"><strong>How do I learn Power BI?<\/strong><\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">The best way to learn Power BI is by enrolling in an online course or attending a training session with a professional instructor. At The Excel Experts, we offer a range of Power BI training options to help you get started. Contact us today to find out more!<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1669809728752\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\"><strong>Can PowerBI be used on Mac?<\/strong><\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Yes, Power BI can be used on a Mac. The Power BI Desktop app is available to download and use on both Windows and Mac. The Power BI Service is also available to use with Mac devices.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1669809741920\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\"><strong>What data sources can be used with Power BI?<\/strong><\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Power BI can connect to a wide range of data sources, including files (CSV, Excel), databases (SQL Server, Oracle) and cloud services (Azure, Google Sheets). It can also connect to more specialised services such as Salesforce and MailChimp.<\/p> <\/div> <\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Discover how Power Bi Training can help businesses make better data drive decisions using key insights and metrics.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":28932,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"om_disable_all_campaigns":false,"_monsterinsights_skip_tracking":false,"footnotes":""},"ca